GaugeNotebookBuild`addInput["pMatrix={{-((gg^2*ps^2*(1 + 2*u)*(-1 + w)*(1 + w))/(hh^2*(-1 + 2*u)*w^2)) + (gg^2*qh1*(1 + 2*u)*(-1 + w)*(1 + w))/(hh^2*(-1 + 2*u)*w^2) + (4*gg^2*ps*(1 + 2*u)*(I*u + 3*Pi*w^2 + 2*Pi*u*w^2 - I*u*w^4))/(hh^2*(-1 + 2*u)*(3 + 2*u)*(-1 - I*w)*w^2*(I + w)) - (gg*(2*gg + 8*gg*u^2 - (12*I)*hh^2*w - (37*I)*hh^2*u*w - (30*I)*hh^2*u^2*w - (8*I)*hh^2*u^3*w + 2*gg*w^2 - 9*gg*Pi^2*w^2 + (8*I)*gg*Pi*u*w^2 - 42*gg*Pi^2*u*w^2 + 8*gg*u^2*w^2 + (32*I)*gg*Pi*u^2*w^2 - 60*gg*Pi^2*u^2*w^2 + (32*I)*gg*Pi*u^3*w^2 - 24*gg*Pi^2*u^3*w^2 - (14*I)*hh^2*w^3 - (41*I)*hh^2*u*w^3 - (30*I)*hh^2*u^2*w^3 - (8*I)*hh^2*u^3*w^3 - 2*gg*w^4 + 18*gg*Pi^2*w^4 + (8*I)*gg*Pi*u*w^4 + 84*gg*Pi^2*u*w^4 - 8*gg*u^2*w^4 + (32*I)*gg*Pi*u^2*w^4 + 120*gg*Pi^2*u^2*w^4 + (32*I)*gg*Pi*u^3*w^4 + 48*gg*Pi^2*u^3*w^4 + (8*I)*hh^2*w^5 + (29*I)*hh^2*u*w^5 + (30*I)*hh^2*u^2*w^5 + (8*I)*hh^2*u^3*w^5 - 2*gg*w^6 + 3*gg*Pi^2*w^6 + 14*gg*Pi^2*u*w^6 - 8*gg*u^2*w^6 + 20*gg*Pi^2*u^2*w^6 + 8*gg*Pi^2*u^3*w^6 + (10*I)*hh^2*w^7 + (33*I)*hh^2*u*w^7 + (30*I)*hh^2*u^2*w^7 + (8*I)*hh^2*u^3*w^7))/(hh^2*(-1 + 2*u)*(1 + 2*u)*(3 + 2*u)*w^2*(-I + w)^2*(I + w)^2), ((I/4)*gg*(1 + 2*u)*w)/(u^2*(-1 + 2*u)), ((-2*I)*gg*u*(1 + 2*u))/((-1 + 2*u)*w), ((2*I)*gg*u*(1 + 2*u))/((-1 + 2*u)*w), ((-I)*gg*(1 + 2*u))/((-1 + 2*u)*w)}, {(gg^2*ps^2*(-1 + w)*(1 + w))/(hh^2*w^2) - (gg^2*qh1*(-1 + w)*(1 + w))/(hh^2*w^2) + (4*gg^2*ps*(I*u + Pi*w^2 + 2*Pi*u*w^2 - I*u*w^4))/(hh^2*(1 + 2*u)*(-1 + I*w)*w^2*(-I + w)) + (gg*(2*gg + I*hh^2*u*w + 2*gg*w^2 - 3*gg*Pi^2*w^2 + (8*I)*gg*Pi*u*w^2 - 6*gg*Pi^2*u*w^2 - (2*I)*hh^2*w^3 + I*hh^2*u*w^3 - 2*gg*w^4 + 6*gg*Pi^2*w^4 + (8*I)*gg*Pi*u*w^4 + 12*gg*Pi^2*u*w^4 - (4*I)*hh^2*w^5 - I*hh^2*u*w^5 - 2*gg*w^6 + gg*Pi^2*w^6 + 2*gg*Pi^2*u*w^6 - (2*I)*hh^2*w^7 - I*hh^2*u*w^7))/(hh^2*(1 + 2*u)*w^2*(-I + w)^2*(I + w)^2), ((-1/4*I)*gg*w)/u^2, ((2*I)*gg*u)/w, 0, (I*gg)/w}};\npBasis=Prepend[Array[master,4],1];\npTemplates=pMatrix.pBasis;\nGrid[Prepend[MapThread[Prepend[formGauge /@ #1,#2]&,{pMatrix[[All,2;;]],{\"P_L-R_L\",\"P_T-R_T\"}}],{\"coefficient\",\"F1\",\"F2\",\"F3\",\"F4\"}],Frame->All,Alignment->Left]"];
GaugeNotebookBuild`addInput["pCompact=Map[Collect[#,Array[master,4],Function[c,FullSimplify[c,w>1,TimeConstraint->2]]]&,pTemplates];\nbetaHard=(1+2u)/(1-2u);\npDifference=Factor /@ (pMatrix[[1]]-betaHard pMatrix[[2]]);\nrTransverse=pMatrix[[2,1]];\nrTComponents=Factor /@ {Coefficient[Expand[rTransverse/.{ps->0,qh1->0}],gg,2] hh^2,Coefficient[rTransverse,ps,1] hh^2/gg^2,Coefficient[rTransverse,ps,2] hh^2/gg^2,Coefficient[Expand[rTransverse/.{ps->0,qh1->0}],gg,1]};\nrDComponents=Factor /@ {Coefficient[Expand[pDifference[[1]]/.ps->0],gg,2] hh^2,Coefficient[pDifference[[1]],ps,1] hh^2/gg^2,Coefficient[Expand[pDifference[[1]]/.ps->0],gg,1]};\npPresentationCheck=FullSimplify[{rTransverse-(gg^2/hh^2)(rTComponents[[1]]+rTComponents[[2]]ps+rTComponents[[3]](ps^2-qh1))-gg rTComponents[[4]],pDifference[[1]]-(gg^2/hh^2)(rDComponents[[1]]+rDComponents[[2]]ps)-gg rDComponents[[3]]},w>1,TimeConstraint->2];\nColumn[{\"R_T = (g^2/h^2) [r0 + r1 psi + r2 (psi^2 - psi1h)] + g r3\",Grid[MapThread[{#1,formGauge[#2]}&,{{\"r0\",\"r1\",\"r2\",\"r3\"},rTComponents}],Frame->All],\"P_L = beta P_T + DeltaR + c F3\",Grid[{{\"beta\",formGauge[betaHard]},{\"c\",formGauge[pDifference[[4]]]}},Frame->All],\"DeltaR = (g^2/h^2) (d0 + d1 psi) + g d2\",Grid[MapThread[{#1,formGauge[#2]}&,{{\"d0\",\"d1\",\"d2\"},rDComponents}],Frame->All]},Spacings->2]"];
GaugeNotebookBuild`addInput["pAnalytic[v_]:=(pMatrix/.commonRules[v]).Prepend[masterExpressions/.nu->v,1];\nP2LGauge[v_]:=pAnalytic[v][[1]]; P2TGauge[v_]:=pAnalytic[v][[2]];"];
GaugeNotebookBuild`addText["Subsection","Stable numerical evaluation of the mixed derivative"];
GaugeNotebookBuild`addText["Text","For F4, let F(z) = regularized 3F2({2 I nu,1/2-I nu,1};{1+z,1+z};1). Symmetry gives F4 = [z^2] F(z) - d_c^2 regularized 2F1(2 I nu,1/2-I nu;c;1)|c=1. The second term follows from Gauss summation. The first is evaluated by a discrete Cauchy integral on |z|=1/128. Sample count grows with requested precision; convergence and agreement with the original derivative are tested below. This evaluates an analytic parameter derivative, not a finite-regulator approximation to P."];
GaugeNotebookBuild`addInput["(* Numerically evaluate the one genuinely mixed parameter derivative. *)\nmixedMaster[v_?NumericQ,prec_Integer,n_Integer:0]:=Module[{vv=N[v,prec+20],a,b,rad=1/128,nn,vals,gauss,pure},a=2I vv;b=1/2-I vv;nn=If[n==0,8 Ceiling[(prec+8)/(8 Log[10,64])],n];\n vals=Table[With[{z=N[rad Exp[2Pi I j/nn],prec+20]},HypergeometricPFQ[{a,b,1},{1+z,1+z},1]/Gamma[1+z]^2 Exp[-4Pi I j/nn]],{j,0,nn-1}];\n gauss=Gamma[1-a-b]/(Gamma[1-a]Gamma[1-b]);\n pure=gauss ((PolyGamma[0,1-a-b]-PolyGamma[0,1-a]-PolyGamma[0,1-b])^2+PolyGamma[1,1-a-b]-PolyGamma[1,1-a]-PolyGamma[1,1-b]);\n N[Total[vals]/(nn rad^2)-pure,prec]];\n"];
GaugeNotebookBuild`addInput["hardCache=<||>; hardEvaluations=0;\nhardValues[v_?NumericQ,prec_Integer:30]:=Module[{vv=N[v,prec+30],mv,result},If[KeyExistsQ[hardCache,{v,prec}],Return[hardCache[{v,prec}]]];hardEvaluations++;\n mv=Append[N[Take[masterExpressions,3]/.nu->vv,prec+10],mixedMaster[v,prec+10]];\n result=N[(pMatrix/.commonRules[vv]).Prepend[mv,1],prec];\n If[Length[result]==2 && VectorQ[result,NumericQ] && FreeQ[result,Indeterminate|DirectedInfinity[_]],AssociateTo[hardCache,{v,prec}->result];result,$Failed]];\nclearGaugeCache[]:=(hardCache=<||>;hardEvaluations=0;);\nGrid[Prepend[Table[Prepend[N[hardValues[v,wp],12],v],{v,{1/100,1/10,3/5,1}}],{\"nu\",\"P_L\",\"P_T\"}],Frame->All]"];
GaugeNotebookBuild`addText["Section","3. Bubble, triangle and the five box angular coefficients"];
GaugeNotebookBuild`addInput["commonLoop[v_]:=Gamma[-I v]^4 gSoft[v]/(4Pi)^(7/2);\nboxTemplate=Factor /@ FullSimplify[(pl-pt)^2 loopMatrix+pt(2pl+pt)rBubble/3{1,0,0,0,0},assumptions];\ncoefficientNames={\"Bubble\",\"Triangle\",\"A1\",\"A2\",\"A3\",\"B\",\"D\"};\nallTemplates=Join[{pOne^2 rBubble,pOne(pl+2pt)rBubble/3},boxTemplate];\nGrid[MapThread[{#1,formGauge[#2]}&,{coefficientNames,allTemplates}],Frame->All]\n"];
GaugeNotebookBuild`addText["Text","Each expression in the preceding table multiplies K(nu) = Gamma(-I nu)^4 G(nu)/(4 Pi)^(7/2). The box angular basis is displayed in Section 1. B and D denote the coefficients of that basis, with no residual angle factors. All seven coefficients share one pair of P_L,P_T values at each mass. In particular A3 = -3 A2."];
